    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7239" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-πνευσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>recovery of breath: respite from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλίγη δέ τ᾽ ἀνάπνευσις πολέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					11.801
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				16.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>breathing in,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατος,</span> of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				92b
			</span></i>; <i>inhalation,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκπνευσις,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492b8
			</span></i>.</div>
